{"ticker":"NOC","updated":"2026-10-30T23:01:36Z","profile":{"longName":"Northrop Grumman Corporation","shortName":"Northrop Grumman Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.northropgrumman.com","fullTimeEmployees":95000,"marketCap":79206637568,"trailingPE":17.599115,"forwardPE":18.58295,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.817041,"pegRatio":4.21,"targetMeanPrice":636.0,"targetHighPrice":815.0,"targetLowPrice":430.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.067,"earningsGrowth":0.029,"grossMargins":0.20025,"operatingMargins":0.12911001,"profitMargins":0.103690006,"totalRevenue":43591000064,"beta":-0.112,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":774.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":470.06,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.76},"summary":"Northrop Grumman Corporation operates as an aerospace and defense technology company in the United States, Asia/Pacific, Europe, and internationally. It operates through four segments: Aeronautics Systems, Defense Systems, Mission Systems and Space Systems. The Aeronautics Systems segment designs, develops, produces, integrates, sustains, and modernizes aircraft systems. This segment also offers unmanned autonomous aircraft systems, including high-altitude long-endurance strategic, surveillance and reconnaissance systems; and strategic long-range strike aircraft, tactical fighter and air dominance aircraft, and airborne battle management and command and control systems. Its Defense Systems segment designs, develops, integrates, and produces strategic deterrent systems, tactical weapons, and missile defense solutions; and provides sustainment, modernization, and training services for manned and unmanned aircraft and electronics systems. This segment also offers strategic missiles; integrated all-domain command and control systems; precision strike weapons; tactical solid rocket motors, and high-speed air-breathing and hypersonic systems; high-performance gun systems, ammunition, precision munitions, and advanced fuzes; and sustainment, operation, and modernization. The Mission Systems segment provides command, control, communication and computer, intelligence, surveillance, and ","summary_zh":"諾斯羅普·格魯曼公司是一家航空航太和國防技術公司，業務遍及美國、亞太地區、歐洲和國際市場。它透過四個部門運作：航空系統、國防系統、任務系統和太空系統。航空系統部門設計、開發、生產、整合、維護和現代化飛機系統。該部門還提供無人駕駛飛機系統，包括高空長航時戰略、監視和偵察系統；戰略遠程攻擊機、戰術戰鬥機和製空飛機以及機載作戰管理和指揮控制系統。其國防系統部門設計、開發、整合和生產戰略威懾系統、戰術武器和飛彈防禦解決方案；並為有人駕駛和無人駕駛飛機及電子系統提供維護、現代化和訓練服務。該細分市場還提供戰略飛彈；整合的全局指揮和控制系統；精確打擊武器；戰術固體火箭發動機、高速吸氣式和高超音速系統；高性能火砲系統、彈藥、精確彈藥和先進引信；以及維持、運作和現代化。任務系統部門提供指揮、控制、通訊和電腦、情報、監視和","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":591.88,"h":596.16,"l":585.26,"c":589.32,"v":635600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":586.53,"h":588.0,"l":577.69,"c":581.01,"v":463200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":581.71,"h":581.94,"l":576.0,"c":579.76,"v":505500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":579.34,"h":581.17,"l":574.82,"c":580.8,"v":633600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":574.99,"h":582.13,"l":571.37,"c":581.9,"v":814100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":580.46,"h":580.49,"l":571.44,"c":571.63,"v":482500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":571.24,"h":580.84,"l":570.0,"c":579.87,"v":547300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":579.31,"h":585.76,"l":578.0,"c":582.95,"v":901100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":582.34,"h":583.13,"l":575.18,"c":575.96,"v":717900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":574.0,"h":576.47,"l":571.12,"c":574.54,"v":804600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":578.0,"h":587.24,"l":575.95,"c":579.36,"v":1104500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":579.1,"h":585.0,"l":576.39,"c":577.08,"v":790200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":572.0,"h":576.98,"l":568.32,"c":573.75,"v":798900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":571.91,"h":576.15,"l":565.5,"c":573.03,"v":1478200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":573.69,"h":577.65,"l":570.26,"c":576.15,"v":566700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":576.0,"h":580.67,"l":571.08,"c":577.08,"v":656300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":580.64,"h":589.6,"l":577.0,"c":586.27,"v":784200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":590.0,"h":593.75,"l":582.49,"c":585.77,"v":1073900},{"